    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706410/extras/7474f010612f157ab2aa1f2b38f4355f.avif?t=1755275917\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a war-torn land plagued by lust-driven invaders, three heroines: Angela, Chris, and Emilia, fight to protect what's left of their nation. As the frontlines heat up, danger comes not only from enemies, but also from within, as chaos threatens everyone. To endure, the team must rely on strength, strategy, and a bit of composure when the situation gets a little... complicated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706410/extras/9cae952824ed8bdc312cdae4a9587fa5.avif?t=1755275917\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of elite knight Angela, fierce warrior Chris, and devoted sister Emilia in this bullet heaven-style action game. Fight through 80 increasingly challenging stages, fending off relentless waves of enemies, just itching to get their hands on you. Use a wide variety of weapons, potions, and ultimate skills to survive against lust-driven foes. Between battles, rest up and have Leia sell loot for materials and coins. Gather resources to unlock specialized facilities like blacksmiths and potion shops. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your Health Points though! The lower they get, the less your clothes hide from prying eyes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers adjustable difficulty to suit all player types, along with voice-acted steamy events, a recollection room, and a full unlock option for your convenience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706410/extras/97be601bbdf9fa4a017943563a6c514b.avif?t=1755275917\" width=616 height=120 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706410/extras/5fe0e26e31c8644db66358ee28622939.avif?t=1755275917\" width=616 height=608 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706410/extras/5d9e8f011c2a4ae163fa434955987e7a.avif?t=1755275917\" width=616 height=608 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706410/extras/18ac65c4e915ea2f32ee065a43bc6ae1.avif?t=1755275917\" width=616 height=608 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706410/extras/a37bbce30396fa833987ff4f5f6d1c9b.avif?t=1755275917\" width=616 height=608 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706410/extras/17f24d5795a51640fe894ce18ab6a02e.avif?t=1755275917\" width=616 height=608 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706410/extras/00c2cb888ffc41fce0e80f387bc2503d.avif?t=1755275917\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Status Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning battles earns you upgrade points to power up the three heroines. Boost their Health Points, increase their strength, or make them more resilient. Want a nun who punches like a warrior? Go for it! The builds are entirely up to you, so customize it to fit your playstyle.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, you'll earn loot, and it's up to you how to use it. Equip it if it's better than your current gear, or have Leia sell it at the shop for materials and coins. Once you've gathered enough resources, you can construct specialized facilities, like a blacksmith for upgrading equipment or a witch\u2019s hut to brew potions for your team. And yes, you can even build and manage a man\u2019s ultimate dream... a brothel!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steamy Events for the Ladies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angela, Chris, and Emilia may find themselves in danger during battle, so be sure to keep an eye on the capture bar! The world is filled with mini-games that can trigger different scenes depending on which heroine you're playing. While the frontline fights for survival, the support team may also run into trouble while shopping or transporting materials, so keep an eye on them too!&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reminiscence Room</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy each unlocked scene as many times as you want by replaying them in the Reminiscence Room!&quot;</p>",
