\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, you'll earn loot, and it's up to you how to use it. Equip it if it's better than your current gear, or have Leia sell it at the shop for materials and coins. Once you've gathered enough resources, you can construct specialized facilities, like a blacksmith for upgrading equipment or a witch\u2019s hut to brew potions for your team. And yes, you can even build and manage a man\u2019s ultimate dream... a brothel!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steamy Events for the Ladies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angela, Chris, and Emilia may find themselves in danger during battle, so be sure to keep an eye on the capture bar! The world is filled with mini-games that can trigger different scenes depending on which heroine you're playing. While the frontline fights for survival, the support team may also run into trouble while shopping or transporting materials, so keep an eye on them too!&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reminiscence Room</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy each unlocked scene as many times as you want by replaying them in the Reminiscence Room!&quot;</p>",
